  "scope": "All collectors with >=50 cargo one to five steps from own home at t=11+13*k, with >=6 transitions remaining. Both seats. 6-step open-loop label: all five focal moves; subsequent routes greedily choose a plausible shortest move using only current public board, never next recorded opponent moves. Other unit paths/orders shared across arms, a surrogate, not causal response. Track the initial load plus extra carbon acquired when staying, bounded by the observed/replayed local board and actual collection rules, including room for a one-beat gather then bank. Report immediate bank, earned cargo and lost cargo separately. Positive for discounted own bank; negative for enemy seizure or enemy-base transfer; otherwise zero. Discount .90. No fabricated target for ended/fault games. Compare learned to shortest-home and prior one-step hazard head, ties favor closest home then fixed action; logged action also measured. Group all scores by physical map. Network: 12 hidden tanh units on action features; loss on per-root centered action values, full-batch map-weighted MSE plus .002/2 squared parameters; seed53219, up to160 L-BFGS steps, train-only scaling. Lower equal-map top1 regret vs both reference methods, also report map count, switches and factual logged behavior. No tuning after held.",
  "weights_unit": "initial cargo fraction, surrogate task; actual carrier bank and death separately on factual trajectories.",
  "version": 2,
  "v1_sha256": "f03ccd52152b42dceacce2efed9f5964ad4d1279ad64991f78c18d56dcd9acef",
  "superseded_before_data_extraction": "All collectors with >=50 cargo one to four steps from own home at t=11+13*k, with >=4 transitions remaining. Both seats. 4-step open-loop label: all five focal moves; subsequent routes greedily choose a plausible shortest move using only current public board, never next recorded opponent moves. Other unit paths/orders shared across arms, a surrogate, not causal response. Track initial carried amount only. Positive for discounted own bank; negative for enemy seizure or enemy-base transfer; otherwise zero. Discount .90. No fabricated target for ended/fault games. Compare learned to shortest-home and prior one-step hazard head, ties favor closest home then fixed action; logged action also measured. Group all scores by physical map. Network: 12 hidden tanh units on action features; loss on per-root centered action values, full-batch map-weighted MSE plus .002/2 squared parameters; seed53219, up to160 L-BFGS steps, train-only scaling. Lower equal-map top1 regret vs both reference methods, also report map count, switches and factual logged behavior. No tuning after held.",
  "additional_diagnostics": "First 4 steps and first realized bank/seizure at step 5 or 6 separate. Include known t93 and 174 as exposed examples only; not using either score in fitting or held evaluation."
}
